WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.180
<i>Twelve years ago,</i>

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:09.110
<i>a great disaster
called Blast Fall occurred.</i>

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.190
<i>Many people died and many
people went missing.</i>

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.850
<i>Even among the survivors,</i>

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:22.490
<i>many were injured severely enough
to interfere with their daily lives.</i>

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.560
<i>In order to complement
such people's physical abilities,</i>

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.640
<i>a certain technology rapidly
spread throughout this town.</i>

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.900
<i>That is resemble, the substitute
for flesh and bone.</i>

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.150
This is-?!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.620
<i>This body is all machine.</i>

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>Not a single shred
of this tissue is organic.</i>

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.620
<i>Truly a solid piece
of resemble technology.</i>

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.190
<i>From the top of that head
to the tips of those toes,</i>

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.430
<i>this body is made entirely
of artificial material.</i>

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.960
<i>I don't really understand.</i>

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.760
<i>Simply put, a resemble is someone
who was originally human</i>

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:03.030
<i>and is merely substituting
parts of their body with machinery.</i>

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:06.970
<i>But I've verified through this data
that the owner of this body is a being,</i>

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>who was built by human hands
entirely from scratch!</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.840
<i>Even the brain?</i>

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.810
<i>Of course.</i>

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:18.080
<i>There's a paper on
resemble technology here,</i>

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.020
<i>but even with the best
of our current technology,</i>

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.290
<i>the maximum resemblizing possible
is thought to be 60% of the body.</i>

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.830
<i>But this body
is 100% resemble.</i>

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.030
<i>State- of- the- art technology
and state- of- the- art systems</i>

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:31.730
<i>have been put together with exquisite
balance beyond our knowledge.</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.470
<i>It is truly a piece that
could be called a work of art.</i>

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.770
<i>And the owner of this body
is none other than...</i>

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:39.830
<i>...Solty!</i>

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:48.950
<i>H-Hey...</i>

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:50.580
<i>There's no need to worry.</i>

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.550
<i>Current resemble technology</i>

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:55.320
<i>can even completely replicate
the digestive organs.</i>

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.690
<i>So, Solty is man-made...</i>

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:01.220
<i>No wonder she's weird.</i>

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:13.240
<i>Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:21.410
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:31.390
<i>Bokura wa marude ichimai-chigai
no guuzen o sagashiatte</i>

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.560
<i>Meguriatta</i>

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:41.630
<i>Kimi ga itsuka
nomikonda sono kotoba yori</i>

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:50.580
<i>Zutto iezu ni
itekureteta yasashisa o</i>

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:57.550
<i>Shinjitai to ima omounda</i>

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:05.290
<i>Nee kono saki wa doko made mo
fuan to tonari-awase</i>

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:11.700
<i>Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai</i>

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:19.400
<i>Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:25.580
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.480
<i>Tsumikasanete
yuku mono</i>

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.030
<i>I'd been thinking
she was a little odd,</i>

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.700
<i>but I guess that was
because she was a robot.</i>

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.900
<i>A robot?!
How insulting!</i>

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.230
<i>Please call her the greatest masterpiece
born of prosthetic technology!</i>

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.200
<i>Greatest masterpiece?!</i>

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.640
<i>That thing?!</i>

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.210
<i>But somehow, I feel like
it all makes sense now.</i>

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.210
<i>What about you, Roy?</i>

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.380
<i>Beats me.</i>

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:04.650
<i>Or are you relieved to know
that Solty isn't human?</i>

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:05.880
<i>Not particularly.</i>

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.050
<i>That reminds me,
where's Solty?</i>

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.250
<i>Probably out
on her usual walk.</i>

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.150
<i>Wh-What is the matter?</i>

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.930
<i>I see.
So you are lost.</i>

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:58.130
<i>Yeah. My mom hurt her leg...</i>

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.400
<i>...and I came out
to shop in her place,</i>

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.310
<i>but I don't know
how to get home now.</i>

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:07.440
<i>If I could just get to the station,
I could get home.</i>

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.410
<i>The station?</i>

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.950
<i>Do you know where it is, Miss?</i>

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.950
<i>What? Oh...
I-I am sorry.</i>

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:18.920
<i>Oh! P-Please do not cry!</i>

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:23.630
<i>All right then! I will
help you find the station!</i>

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:24.760
<i>Really?!</i>

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.130
<i>Yes, really.</i>

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.230
<i>I am Solty Revant.</i>

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.060
<i>Meryl Tyler.</i>

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.420
<i>Wow!</i>

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.230
<i>Oh! You...</i>

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:03.230
<i>Yes?</i>

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.930
<i>You got on the train with me...</i>

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.070
<i>Oh, you are right.</i>

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:11.210
<i>In that case, please allow me
to walk you all the way home.</i>

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.870
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:20.150
<i>Th-That reminds me,
how is your mom's injury?</i>

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.850
<i>It's supposed to get better
if she just rests for a while.</i>

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.590
<i>Besides, Dad's helping out a lot, too.</i>

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.460
<i>What a nice dad!</i>

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.230
<i>Isn't your dad nice?</i>

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:34.400
<i>H-He is... kind...</i>

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.000
<i>But he is scary!
He is always angry!</i>

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.800
<i>With wrinkles gathering right here.</i>

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.340
<i>I wonder if things
aren't going well at work.</i>

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.910
<i>I do not know.</i>

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:48.740
<i>Oh! Mom taught me
the secret magic words</i>

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:53.380
<i>to put Dad in a better mood
at times like that!</i>

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.750
<i>Really?</i>

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.990
<i>Please teach it to me, too.</i>

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.480
<i>Okay, so...</i>

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.690
<i>Give it a try.</i>

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.920
<i>Yes, I will give it a try.</i>

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.570
<i>Just like in the simulation.</i>

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:36.190
<i>Jack McLean.
Death-row convict No. 11467.</i>

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:39.530
<i>Experimental subject
No. 4385, are you not?!</i>

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:41.800
<i>So the RUC sent you after me...</i>

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.300
<i>Using state- of- the- art technology,</i>

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:46.500
<i>you've become resemblized up to 78%.</i>

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.170
<i>You destroyed the safeties and your beacon
during an experiment and fled.</i>

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:52.480
<i>Thanks to that, we had to go
to a lot of trouble for you.</i>

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:53.980
<i>How did you know
I would be here?</i>

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.580
<i>You fell into the trap yourself.</i>

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.550
What?

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.910
<i>Just like our agent predicted.</i>

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.050
<i>Good work, Accela!</i>

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:04.850
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.860
<i>Go back to the lab quietly!</i>

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.190
<i>What if I say no?</i>

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.430
<i>Now, what'll it be, McLean?</i>

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.530
<i>- Shoot!
- Damn it!</i>

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.510
<i>Ouch...</i>

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.220
<i>My eyes are stinging
and I can't take aim.</i>

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.880
<i>- Let's go home alrea-
- Celica!</i>

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:38.490
<i>Can you track him?</i>

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:39.820
<i>Not immediately...</i>

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.460
<i>What are we going to do, Integra?</i>

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.760
<i>Let's just go home.
We'll pick this up again tomorrow.</i>

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:46.200
<i>You shut up!</i>

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.160
<i>Let's pull out for now.</i>

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.500
<i>I guess there's no helping it.</i>

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.970
Yay!

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.970
<i>We underestimated our opponent.</i>

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.300
<i>We'll have to rework our strategy.</i>

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.250
<i>Mom, I'm home!</i>

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.120
<i>Welcome back, Meryl.</i>

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:13.760
<i>Thank you so much for
accompanying her all the way home.</i>

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.460
<i>Oh, it was nothing.</i>

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.530
<i>How would you like
to join us for dinner?</i>

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.330
What?

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.130
<i>Yeah! Stay, Miss!</i>

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:22.130
Uh, um...

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.530
<i>Help me out, okay, Meryl?</i>

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:24.570
<i>Sure!</i>

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:26.540
<i>I'll go get the tea ready.</i>

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.740
<i>Helping you to lead
safe and healthy lives</i>

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:36.280
<i>is all of us
at the RUC Group.</i>

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:40.420
<i>When someone's been nice to you,
you should return that favor.</i>

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.510
Right!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.420
<i>What's the matter, Miss?</i>

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.390
What?

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.760
<i>Is something wrong?</i>

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.690
<i>No, it is nothing like that.</i>

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.560
<i>Well...</i>

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.130
<i>Looking around this home,
it makes me feel happy somehow.</i>

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:00.840
<i>It makes me happy
to hear you say that.</i>

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.770
<i>I'm home.</i>

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.510
<i>Oh? Do we have guests?</i>

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.710
<i>Dad, welcome back!</i>

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.740
<i>I'm home, Meryl.</i>

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.550
<i>How's your leg, Dear?</i>

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:12.950
<i>It's fine.
It's much better now.</i>

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.780
<i>I'm glad to hear that.</i>

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.990
<i>By the way,
who's this young lady?</i>

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:21.190
<i>Oh, n-nice to meet you.
I am Solty Revant.</i>

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:23.590
<i>She was kind enough
to help Meryl today.</i>

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.590
<i>So we invited her
to stay for dinner!</i>

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:27.000
<i>That sounds great!</i>

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.230
<i>Dinner is a joy
with the whole family,</i>

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.000
<i>but guests are most welcome, too!</i>

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.010
Family...

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.940
<i>Oh!</i>

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.240
<i>What's wrong, Miss?</i>

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.780
<i>It is so late already!</i>

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:45.010
<i>I am sorry.
I have to go home!</i>

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.120
<i>- Miss!
- Yes?</i>

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:52.860
<i>U-Um, see you again tomorrow!</i>

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.420
<i>Yes, I will see you again tomorrow!</i>

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.410
Okay!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.100
<i>Thank you for having me!</i>

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.400
<i>That was too bad.</i>

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.890
<i>Oh, we'll have another
chance to do this.</i>

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:10.040
<i>Thanks for ordering from us!</i>

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.270
<i>She's way too late,
no matter how you look at it!</i>

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.380
<i>It's so late already
and she's still not back!</i>

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.980
<i>What shall we do?</i>

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.350
<i>Perhaps we should
contact the police?</i>

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:23.720
<i>It'll be a waste of time!
They're useless!</i>

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:28.520
<i>What are you doing, Roy?!
Aren't you worried about Solty?!</i>

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:32.260
<i>Her body is valuable enough
that she would be worth kidnapping!</i>

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:41.840
<i>Sheesh! What a cold bastard!
And he's a parent?!</i>

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.810
<i>He is a parent.</i>

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:48.440
<i>He's just not very good
at expressing his emotions.</i>

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.050
Damn it!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.610
<i>She's a robot!</i>

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.310
<i>What's the point
in worrying about her?!</i>

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.620
Damn it!

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.300
<i>I have just returned home!</i>

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.170
<i>Today was incredible!</i>

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.170
<i>I met a girl,
who was lost.</i>

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.140
<i>Her name was Miss Meryl</i>

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:18.610
<i>and we worked together
to find a station and get her home</i>

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:20.540
<i>and we became friends!</i>

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:25.680
<i>We promised we would
play together again tomorrow...</i>

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.780
<i>He is angry.</i>

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.820
<i>H- He is very angry.</i>

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.050
<i>Mom taught me
the secret magic words</i>

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:36.230
<i>to put Dad in a better mood
at times like that!</i>

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.230
<i>Oh!</i>

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.560
<i>Now is the time
to try it out.</i>

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.770
Uh, um...

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:43.600
What is it?

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.800
U-Um...

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.740
What is it?
Out with it.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.410
<i>Well...</i>

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.410
<i>This is getting old.</i>

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.100
<i>I love you, Dad!</i>

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:56.940
<i>I love you!</i>

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.990
<i>What is it, Roy?</i>

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.460
<i>Sh-She...</i>

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.430
<i>Solty's come back,
hasn't she?!</i>

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.460
<i>Sh-She's weird.</i>

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.400
What?

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:18.970
<i>She's always been weird.</i>

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.200
<i>Miss Meryl,</i>

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.730
<i>it did not work.</i>

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.680
<i>Huh? Solty?</i>

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.550
<i>Y-Yeah, do you know
where she is?</i>

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:35.720
<i>She went out. Something
about meeting a friend...</i>

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:36.890
<i>Friend?</i>

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.920
<i>Her name was Miss Meryl</i>

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.690
<i>and we worked together
to find a station and get her home</i>

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.730
<i>and we became friends!</i>

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:45.660
Oh!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:46.960
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.660
<i>N-Nothing.</i>

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:55.870
<i>See? He is a parent.</i>

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.670
<i>He's not very honest
about his feelings.</i>

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:02.540
<i>I see, so it didn't work.</i>

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.880
<i>It did not work...</i>

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:09.650
<i>Oh, so what are we
shopping for today?</i>

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:11.080
<i>Well...</i>

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.240
<i>We bought a lot.</i>

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.480
<i>Maybe we bought
a little too much.</i>

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:41.020
<i>You must be tired. I will go
buy something to drink.</i>

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.350
<i>Oh, money...</i>

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:43.990
<i>Not to worry!</i>

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:45.190
What?

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.250
<i>I have this, too!</i>

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.160
<i>Well, I will go now.
Please wait here.</i>

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.650
<i>Thank you...</i>

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.070
<i>I'm in position.</i>

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.070
<i>What do you want to do?
Should we shoot him?</i>

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:05.610
<i>I could easily
bring him down right now.</i>

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.540
<i>Don't be so stupid.</i>

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:10.450
<i>Our top priority for this mission
is to carry it out in secrecy.</i>

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.920
<i>But it'd be easier this way.</i>

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.410
<i>There is no way we can shoot him
with pedestrians around!</i>

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:21.690
<i>E-Excuse me...</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.490
<i>Is something the matter?</i>

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:27.600
<i>Are you not feeling well?</i>

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:28.930
<i>Excuse me...</i>

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.670
Oh?

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.500
<i>Where could Miss Meryl have gone?</i>

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.480
<i>No!</i>

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:57.680
<i>Down there!</i>

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:06.470
<i>- Damn, so they've completely
anticipated every move I'd make.
- Mom...</i>

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:10.000
<i>- Mom... Mom...
- But I doubt even they can do
anything to me with her here.</i>

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.440
Miss!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:13.340
<i>Miss Meryl!</i>

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:17.910
<i>- You were able to react to my speed?!
- Wh-What are you doing all of a sudden?!</i>

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.450
<i>Who the hell are you?!</i>

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.020
<i>I am Solty.</i>

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.640
<i>Wh-What the- ?</i>

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.390
<i>You're a bundle of trouble.</i>

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:32.890
Miss!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:42.300
Miss! Miss! Miss!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:46.740
<i>Hey, was this where her
ID card was abandoned?!</i>

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:48.680
<i>Wh-Who do you mean by "her"?</i>

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:50.480
<i>Solty Revant!</i>

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.850
<i>In that case, it wasn't
abandoned, it was left here.</i>

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:57.220
<i>Along with these bags.</i>

00:16:57.220 --> 00:17:00.090
<i>So, where is she right now?</i>

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.920
<i>We're currently
investigating that.</i>

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:06.190
<i>More importantly, what is your
relation to the owner of this card?!</i>

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.630
This is bad.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.730
<i>People are starting to converge.</i>

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:15.840
<i>It seems the police have contacted
the families of the two below.</i>

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.070
<i>What do you want to do?</i>

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:19.740
<i>Do we charge in before this thing
gets any bigger?</i>

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:20.840
<i>Hold on.</i>

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.610
<i>Failure is not an option.</i>

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:26.710
<i>I've got nothing to do
if the target won't come out.</i>

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.820
<i>I'll go out there in a suit.</i>

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.420
<i>You plan to destroy him?</i>

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.760
<i>It'll be better than having
the secret leak out.</i>

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.190
<i>What about the two civilians?</i>

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.030
<i>Don't ask when you
know the answer.</i>

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.230
<i>I figured as much.</i>

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:41.660
<i>Accela, boot up the system.
I'll need your support.</i>

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.600
All right.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.610
<i>Cocoon has been activated.</i>

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:56.140
<i>Enter the cocoon after
you've put the gel rings on.</i>

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.210
<i>Probe array connected.</i>

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:00.340
<i>Standby for bio- feedback.</i>

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.720
<i>Gel coating complete.</i>

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.660
<i>Standby for hard coating.</i>

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.360
<i>The PSSD system is complete.</i>

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:29.140
Silvia,

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.310
<i>I'll go out when he
makes his next move.</i>

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:32.810
<i>Keep me informed.</i>

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>Roger.</i>

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:46.090
<i>Damn it! I'm never gonna
get anywhere like this.</i>

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:47.230
Shut up!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.060
<i>Quit crying already!</i>

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.890
<i>No!</i>

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:57.410
<i>You're still alive?!</i>

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:59.510
Miss!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.340
Wh-What?

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:08.950
<i>I hate...</i>

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.540
<i>I hate you.</i>

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:23.350
D-Damn it!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.040
I...

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.870
<i>...hate you!</i>

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:20.320
<i>There!
You are safe now.</i>

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.760
<i>No!</i>

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:27.920
<i>- Wh-What is the matter, Meryl?
- N-No! Stay away from me!</i>

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:33.170
<i>Mom! Dad!</i>

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.840
<i>Meryl!</i>

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.500
<i>Thank goodness you're all right!</i>

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.710
<i>That's the girl
from the other day.</i>

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.710
<i>Make arrangements
to recover the body. Quickly.</i>

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.910
<i>Understood.</i>

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.740
<i>Case closed.</i>

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:04.170
<i>She hates me now.</i>

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.970
<i>She was my first friend, but...</i>

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:09.740
<i>She hates me now.</i>

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.370
<i>Hurry!
Let's hurry home!</i>

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.070
<i>What's wrong, Meryl?</i>

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:23.210
<i>She'll understand someday.</i>

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.750
<i>Let's go home.</i>

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:36.760
Okay.

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:58.480
<i>Hareta hi no kouen</i>

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:01.420
<i>Miageta sora ni</i>

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:12.700
<i>Kiesou ni natta chiisana
Little Cloud</i>

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:17.470
<i>Kaze ni mi o makasete</i>

00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:20.410
<i>Jiyuu ni ikiru</i>

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:28.450
<i>Sukoshi-zutsu
aruku watashi-tachi</i>

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.220
<i>Onnaji dane</i>

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:37.960
<i>Taisetsu na jikan</i>

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:41.790
<i>Deau tabi ni</i>

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:51.340
<i>Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru</i>

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:57.910
<i>Dareka o shinjiru
yuuki ni kaete</i>

00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:10.220
<i>Kitto kono mama ano sora
no hate ni kieru mae ni</i>

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.800
<i>I have never been
to such a large bath before!</i>

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:22.340
<i>It's not a bath!
It's a hot spring health resort!</i>

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:24.900
<i>Next time, "Waterside Panic".</i>

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:26.740
<i>Oh? You are...</i>
